==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{cal|ru|fr|exclure}} or {{cal|ru|de|ausschließen|notext=1}}, ultimately a {{cal|ru|la|exclūdō|nocap=1}}, which is a piecewise cognate. {{surf|ru|ис-|-ключи́ть}}. Via {{m+|la|exclūdō}}, {{m|la|exclūsus}}, {{glossary|piecewise doublet}} with {{m|ru|шлюз}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|исключи́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-исключить.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|исключи́ть|pf|impf=исключа́ть}}

# to [[exclude]]
# to [[expel]]
# {{lb|ru|mathematics}} to [[eliminate]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|4b+p|исключи́ть|or|4c|исключи́ть|ppp=исключённый|tail=*|notes=* Somewhat common but non-standard and sometimes proscribed.}}

